<PageTitle>Tooltip — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Tooltip</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Hover <em>and</em> focus, because a tooltip only a mouse can reach is one half the readers
    never see. Escape closes it, which the APG asks for and most implementations forget.
</p>
<p class="doc-note">
    There is no <code>TooltipProvider</code>: shadcn's shares one delay timer across a page, and
    each tooltip here keeps its own. The visible difference is that moving between two adjacent
    triggers waits twice rather than once.
</p>

