<h2 class="doc-h2">Disabled Button</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    A disabled button fires no pointer events, so a tooltip on it never opens — at the one moment
    a reader most needs to be told why. Wrap it: the span takes the hover and the button stays
    disabled.
</p>
